    {
      "order": 2,
      "type": "intro",
      "heading": "歡迎來到 鑽之韻",
      "body": "歡迎來到 鑽之韻 — 專屬於您的鑽石美學空間。",
      "images": [],
      "video": null,
      "links": [],
      "sourceFile": "C:/Users/U01/Desktop/DS/dsdiamond_backup/site/www.dsdiamond.com.tw/pages/about-us.html:1721"
